{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1791333240143403549,"compiled_state":{"alias":"idiotproof-bigboned-cornsnake","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"18f01c359e80f9d77329f3104e8f43d6bfd65d778da98a317447683254157e23","event_uuid":"7634c462-2f40-4d6e-8186-f351e7b52df3","position":{"commit_sha":"62c7ab48629d687da5a40432b7e8759b33774356","position":"1791324542755005377-7634c462-2f40-4d6e-8186-f351e7b52df3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"fe5f90d98e9f1d65a02799a3a36e31779c1365979bf24192a4da13c866d30233","event_uuid":"d8e183cd-675e-41c2-a279-2f628299a6f5","position":{"commit_sha":"1f409556a749288b9c0dcbb64001df562a3e4cd1","position":"1791324563879741022-d8e183cd-675e-41c2-a279-2f628299a6f5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1791324542755005377,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d8e183cd-675e-41c2-a279-2f628299a6f5","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"d8e3-96a2-1c1f-4625"}],"description":"## Observation\nOn October 6, 2026, 7 of the 15 scheduled reconcile-bridge runs from 12:41 AM through 2:30 PM PDT failed. All 7 logs report the same ACLI 120-second timeout while running workitem search for project = REB AND statusCategory = \"Done\" ORDER BY updated DESC with --paginate --json and fields issuetype,key,assignee,priority,status,summary,description,labels. Run IDs: 37431226504, 37444104091, 37456915449, 37465414763, 37488201890, 37519464683, 37527518487. All 15 runs use commit 02a4c71a519e9ec6115969243b2d1a186d6c4c11.\nAWS us-east-1 alarm rebar-bridge-run-failures uses rebar/host bridge_run_failures Sum > 0, 2 of 2 hourly periods, missing data not breaching. Latest ALARM 1:46 PM PDT, OK 2:46 PM PDT. Latest successful run https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/37534400732 reported BRIDGE_STATE: converged at 2:38 PM PDT and published failure metric 0. Failed run https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/37527518487 published 1.\n## Investigation needed\nThe observed failure is a subprocess timeout, not a proved Jira outage or proved undersized timeout. Competing explanations: Jira latency, data volume/pagination cost, ACLI or runner behavior. Compare timed per-page searches and request outcomes on equivalent inputs to separate these; inspect retry and fetch paths before choosing remediation. Successful run still emitted parent hierarchy rejection warnings; convergence does not establish every relationship synced.\n## Acceptance Criteria\n1. Reproduce or instrument the slow Done-ticket fetch and identify the cause using timings, page counts and underlying request results.\n2. Implement a cause-directed remedy with regression coverage; do not treat rerunning or increasing timeout alone as proof of repair.\n3. Verify the affected workflow completes and publishes correct telemetry; record remaining uncertainty and live evidence.\nNo code or production settings changed during initial investigation.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d730-8a25-1813-4106","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Bridge Done-ticket ACLI search intermittently exceeds 120s, triggering recurring AWS alarms","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["7634c462-2f40-4d6e-8186-f351e7b52df3","d8e183cd-675e-41c2-a279-2f628299a6f5"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1791333240143403549,"uuid":"e8462ecf-d8fa-49bf-8bfd-aa964e430bc0"}